  },
  {
   "text": "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow!",
   "tag": "sentence_en",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 3,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 266.45669291338595,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 289.1338582677167
  },
  {
   "text": "When the noise fades, you will hear your soul's real longings.",
   "tag": "sentence_en",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 3,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 198.42519685039383,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 221.10236220472456
  },
  {
   "text": "Falsches Üben von Xylophonmusik quält jeden größeren Zwerg.",
   "tag": "sentence_de",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 3,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 130.3937007874017,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 153.07086614173244
  },
  {
   "text": "Victor jagt zwölf Boxkämpfer quer über den großen Sylter Deich.",
   "tag": "sentence_de",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 3,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 62.36220472440958,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 85.03937007874029
  },
  {
   "text": "Ja, ich fahre. Guten Morgen, Göteborg! Heute schon gejournaled?",
   "tag": "sentence_de",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 4,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 470.5511811023623,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 493.22834645669303
  },
  {
   "text": "Flygande bäckasiner söka hwila på mjuka tuvor. Så är det bara.",
   "tag": "sentence_sv",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 4,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 402.5196850393702,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 425.1968503937009
  },
  {
   "text": "Voix ambiguë d'un cœur qui, au zéphyr, préfère les jattes de kiwis.",
   "tag": "sentence_fr",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 4,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 334.48818897637807,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 357.1653543307088
  },
  {
   "text": "El veloz murciélago hindú comía feliz cardillo y kiwi. ¿Qué? ¡Sí!",
   "tag": "sentence_es",
   "kind": "sentence",
   "page": 4,
   "x_pt": 34.01574803149607,
   "y_pt": 266.45669291338595,
   "w_pt": 773.8582677165356,
   "h_pt": 68.03149606299213,
   "ybase_pt": 289.1338582677167
  },
  {
